{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026FbCKQXErfS1795406249.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>建造創新博覽會一連三日在灣仔會展舉行。發展局局長甯漢豪、建造業議會主席何安誠等出席開幕儀式。</p><p></p><p>創博會以「築見未來，智造非凡」為主題，聚焦人工智能(AI)、機械人、建造安全等四大領域，吸引逾190間本地、海內外參展商參加。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.HKCA-1030_001.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026lhRdzHIcNy1795406303.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>甯漢豪稱，政府的建造業創新及科技基金已累計注資22億元，鼓勵業界採用創新裝置與系統。</p><p></p><p>發展局局長甯漢豪說：「截至今日，這筆資助基金已資助超過700個人工智能項目，以及超過400個、採用逾30種建築機器人項目，總金額超過6億元。為延續這股動力，我們宣布向這項資助基金額外注資10億元，支持業界採用創新科技。」</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-23T04:49:55.579740+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":264,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-23T03:48:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-23T06:44:51.208564+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-23T04:43:21.275111+00:00","content_hash":"f5182c1699d21951c2215877efd9eaf8ddfab8e0db0c71fb48802c4b14b2641b","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}